OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 13 FEB
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores the final
OL,6,     Gyears for the celebrated composer
OL,7,     GHeinrich Schutz, when he received
OL,8,     Ga sudden windfall of a generous
OL,9,     Gpension.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny presents live
OL,12,     Gmusic from baroque Ensemble
OL,13,     GMusica d'Outrora. He is also
OL,14,     Gjoined by pianist Kathryn Stott
OL,15,     Glive in studio.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,19,     Gincluding music from Tchaikovsky,
OL,20,     GFaure, Florence Price, and film
OL,21,     Gcomposer George Fenton.
